[{"text": "The assembly will now hear an address by", "start": 3.6, "duration": 6.8}, {"text": "his excellency Matthew Antonio Patrick", "start": 6.48, "duration": 5.44}, {"text": "Armeni,", "start": 10.4, "duration": 5.92}, {"text": "president of the Republic of Sey Shells.", "start": 11.92, "duration": 6.88}, {"text": "I request protocol to his cause's", "start": 16.32, "duration": 4.799}, {"text": "excellency and invite him to address the", "start": 18.8, "duration": 5.319}, {"text": "assembly.", "start": 21.119, "duration": 3.0}, {"text": "Mr. President,", "start": 40.399, "duration": 5.361}, {"text": "Mr. Secretary General,", "start": 43.36, "duration": 4.4}, {"text": "excellencies,", "start": 45.76, "duration": 5.52}, {"text": "distinguished delegates, good evening,", "start": 47.76, "duration": 7.36}, {"text": "Mr. President, I warmly congratulate you", "start": 51.28, "duration": 6.08}, {"text": "on your election to lead the 81st", "start": 55.12, "duration": 6.0}, {"text": "session of this general assembly.", "start": 57.36, "duration": 6.48}, {"text": "You assume this high office at a", "start": 61.12, "duration": 5.6}, {"text": "defining moment for our organization and", "start": 63.84, "duration": 5.44}, {"text": "for humanity.", "start": 66.72, "duration": 6.399}, {"text": "Seells assures you of its full support", "start": 69.28, "duration": 7.199}, {"text": "and wishes you every success in guiding", "start": 73.119, "duration": 5.201}, {"text": "our work.", "start": 76.479, "duration": 5.28}, {"text": "Mr. Secretary General, as this is the", "start": 78.32, "duration": 6.08}, {"text": "final general assembly you will address", "start": 81.759, "duration": 5.201}, {"text": "in your current capacity,", "start": 84.4, "duration": 5.68}, {"text": "seashells extends its profound gratitude", "start": 86.96, "duration": 5.519}, {"text": "for your decade of dedicated", "start": 90.08, "duration": 3.92}, {"text": "stewardship.", "start": 92.479, "duration": 4.161}, {"text": "You have consistently championed a", "start": 94.0, "duration": 6.479}, {"text": "United Nations that is more effective,", "start": 96.64, "duration": 7.36}, {"text": "responsive, and grounded in the needs of", "start": 100.479, "duration": 6.241}, {"text": "the people we serve.", "start": 104.0, "duration": 6.479}, {"text": "Mr. President, the theme of this session", "start": 106.72, "duration": 6.399}, {"text": "strikes at the core of our contemporary", "start": 110.479, "duration": 4.721}, {"text": "global crisis.", "start": 113.119, "duration": 5.521}, {"text": "Trust has eroded, yet structural", "start": 115.2, "duration": 8.239}, {"text": "transformation is urgently upon us. In a", "start": 118.64, "duration": 7.28}, {"text": "world increasingly fractured by", "start": 123.439, "duration": 6.001}, {"text": "geopolitical rivalry, the answer cannot", "start": 125.92, "duration": 7.2}, {"text": "be a retreat into isolationism.", "start": 129.44, "duration": 7.04}, {"text": "It must be a revitalized commitment to", "start": 133.12, "duration": 5.6}, {"text": "multilateralism.", "start": 136.48, "duration": 5.839}, {"text": "The United Nations must prove that", "start": 138.72, "duration": 6.4}, {"text": "dialogue can bridge division, that", "start": 142.319, "duration": 5.361}, {"text": "international law must prevail over", "start": 145.12, "duration": 6.0}, {"text": "force, and that collective action", "start": 147.68, "duration": 7.04}, {"text": "achieves what you unilateralism", "start": 151.12, "duration": 5.6}, {"text": "never can.", "start": 154.72, "duration": 5.44}, {"text": "Seashells approaches the world guided by", "start": 156.72, "duration": 6.72}, {"text": "an enduring fundamental principle.", "start": 160.16, "duration": 5.84}, {"text": "We are a friend to all and an enemy to", "start": 163.44, "duration": 6.56}, {"text": "none. Our commitment to non-alignment is", "start": 166.0, "duration": 6.72}, {"text": "not a passive indifference. It is an", "start": 170.0, "duration": 5.599}, {"text": "active choice for peace. It is the", "start": 172.72, "duration": 5.92}, {"text": "conviction that principle diplom de", "start": 175.599, "duration": 5.121}, {"text": "democra diplomacy", "start": 178.64, "duration": 5.76}, {"text": "mutual respect and international law are", "start": 180.72, "duration": 6.159}, {"text": "the true foundations of global", "start": 184.4, "duration": 4.32}, {"text": "stability.", "start": 186.879, "duration": 4.801}, {"text": "Small states like ours do not seek", "start": 188.72, "duration": 5.439}, {"text": "strategic competition.", "start": 191.68, "duration": 5.6}, {"text": "We seek shared solutions.", "start": 194.159, "duration": 6.481}, {"text": "This requires a multilateral system that", "start": 197.28, "duration": 6.64}, {"text": "is principled yet practical,", "start": 200.64, "duration": 6.879}, {"text": "ambitious yet accountable and", "start": 203.92, "duration": 8.16}, {"text": "representative yet effective. In short,", "start": 207.519, "duration": 8.72}, {"text": "a United Nations that delivers for all.", "start": 212.08, "duration": 6.239}, {"text": "If multilateralism", "start": 216.239, "duration": 5.601}, {"text": "is to deliver, it must first secure the", "start": 218.319, "duration": 6.64}, {"text": "peace upon which all human progress", "start": 221.84, "duration": 6.72}, {"text": "depends. Without peace, sustainable", "start": 224.959, "duration": 7.28}, {"text": "development is an illusion. Conflict", "start": 228.56, "duration": 7.84}, {"text": "destroy lives, uproots communities, and", "start": 232.239, "duration": 7.121}, {"text": "diverts vital resources away from", "start": 236.4, "duration": 6.16}, {"text": "healthcare, education, and climate", "start": 239.36, "duration": 4.72}, {"text": "resilience.", "start": 242.56, "duration": 4.319}, {"text": "We must reject the normalization", "start": 244.08, "duration": 5.76}, {"text": "of perpetual conflict and the selective", "start": 246.879, "duration": 6.56}, {"text": "application of international law.", "start": 249.84, "duration": 6.08}, {"text": "International law must apply equally to", "start": 253.439, "duration": 6.64}, {"text": "all without exception, bias or double", "start": 255.92, "duration": 5.76}, {"text": "standards.", "start": 260.079, "duration": 4.161}, {"text": "This principle is vital to maritime", "start": 261.68, "duration": 5.519}, {"text": "security. The oceans are the lifeblood", "start": 264.24, "duration": 6.64}, {"text": "of global trade. When maritime roots are", "start": 267.199, "duration": 6.56}, {"text": "threatened by piracy, geopolitical", "start": 270.88, "duration": 6.8}, {"text": "friction or armed aggression, the shocks", "start": 273.759, "duration": 6.72}, {"text": "ripple far beyond regional waters,", "start": 277.68, "duration": 6.079}, {"text": "devastating ver vulnerable island", "start": 280.479, "duration": 4.961}, {"text": "economies.", "start": 283.759, "duration": 3.921}, {"text": "Freedom of navigation and maritime", "start": 285.44, "duration": 5.28}, {"text": "security must be preserved under", "start": 287.68, "duration": 6.48}, {"text": "international law. Small and vulnerable", "start": 290.72, "duration": 6.88}, {"text": "states like ours should never bear the", "start": 294.16, "duration": 7.039}, {"text": "collateral economic cost of conflicts in", "start": 297.6, "duration": 5.92}, {"text": "which it have no part.", "start": 301.199, "duration": 5.521}, {"text": "Furthermore, we firmly reject unilateral", "start": 303.52, "duration": 5.84}, {"text": "coercive measures that violate", "start": 306.72, "duration": 4.96}, {"text": "international law and inflict", "start": 309.36, "duration": 5.279}, {"text": "disproportionate hardship on innocent", "start": 311.68, "duration": 4.72}, {"text": "populations.", "start": 314.639, "duration": 5.041}, {"text": "Yet our global architecture is failing", "start": 316.4, "duration": 6.639}, {"text": "to reinforce these principles because", "start": 319.68, "duration": 7.28}, {"text": "its key organs remain outdated. The", "start": 323.039, "duration": 7.201}, {"text": "Security Council's inability to act", "start": 326.96, "duration": 6.56}, {"text": "decisively in moments of global crisis", "start": 330.24, "duration": 6.64}, {"text": "and minds its very purpose.", "start": 333.52, "duration": 6.8}, {"text": "Its composition reflects a bygon era,", "start": 336.88, "duration": 7.52}, {"text": "not 21st century geopolitical realities.", "start": 340.32, "duration": 6.0}, {"text": "Reform is no longer a matter of", "start": 344.4, "duration": 5.28}, {"text": "political convenience. It is a matter of", "start": 346.32, "duration": 7.36}, {"text": "institutional survival and legitimacy.", "start": 349.68, "duration": 6.72}, {"text": "Seals therefore reaffirms Africa's", "start": 353.68, "duration": 4.959}, {"text": "unified position.", "start": 356.4, "duration": 6.079}, {"text": "Our continent must hold no fewer than", "start": 358.639, "duration": 6.56}, {"text": "two permanent seats on the security", "start": 362.479, "duration": 6.16}, {"text": "council with full prerogatives", "start": 365.199, "duration": 6.72}, {"text": "including the veto for as long as it", "start": 368.639, "duration": 4.801}, {"text": "exist.", "start": 371.919, "duration": 5.761}, {"text": "Mr. President, this past June, Shells", "start": 373.44, "duration": 6.879}, {"text": "proudly celebrated 50 years of", "start": 377.68, "duration": 4.32}, {"text": "independence.", "start": 380.319, "duration": 4.801}, {"text": "Half a century of self-determination", "start": 382.0, "duration": 7.28}, {"text": "has taught us a fundamental lesson.", "start": 385.12, "duration": 7.76}, {"text": "Size do does not define sovereignty and", "start": 389.28, "duration": 7.6}, {"text": "geography does not diminish dignity. We", "start": 392.88, "duration": 6.96}, {"text": "may be a small island developing state", "start": 396.88, "duration": 5.36}, {"text": "but we sit as an equal participant in", "start": 399.84, "duration": 6.079}, {"text": "this hall. Every nation regardless of", "start": 402.24, "duration": 7.04}, {"text": "population or economic power possesses", "start": 405.919, "duration": 6.481}, {"text": "an inherent right to sovereignty,", "start": 409.28, "duration": 5.759}, {"text": "territorial integrity and national", "start": 412.4, "duration": 4.48}, {"text": "dignity.", "start": 415.039, "duration": 5.361}, {"text": "Today, however, sovereignty faces quiet", "start": 416.88, "duration": 6.96}, {"text": "insidious threats. Transnational", "start": 420.4, "duration": 7.199}, {"text": "organized crime, drug trafficking, and", "start": 423.84, "duration": 7.12}, {"text": "illegal and reported and unregulated", "start": 427.599, "duration": 7.04}, {"text": "fishing threaten our security, wreck our", "start": 430.96, "duration": 6.639}, {"text": "marine ecosystems, and steal from our", "start": 434.639, "duration": 5.601}, {"text": "people. Because these threats are", "start": 437.599, "duration": 5.521}, {"text": "interconnected, our response must be", "start": 440.24, "duration": 5.28}, {"text": "equally integrated.", "start": 443.12, "duration": 4.96}, {"text": "stronger international intelligence", "start": 445.52, "duration": 6.399}, {"text": "sharing, expanded maritime surveillance", "start": 448.08, "duration": 7.2}, {"text": "and practical law enforcement support.", "start": 451.919, "duration": 6.641}, {"text": "It is unreasonable to expect nations", "start": 455.28, "duration": 6.319}, {"text": "safeguarding vast oceanic domains with", "start": 458.56, "duration": 6.32}, {"text": "modest budgets to meet standards set by", "start": 461.599, "duration": 5.761}, {"text": "heavily resource states without", "start": 464.88, "duration": 5.68}, {"text": "providing them the tools to do so.", "start": 467.36, "duration": 6.08}, {"text": "Resilience without resources is not", "start": 470.56, "duration": 6.72}, {"text": "resilience. It is merely survival. The", "start": 473.44, "duration": 6.4}, {"text": "same logic applies directly to the", "start": 477.28, "duration": 6.4}, {"text": "climate crisis. For socials, climate", "start": 479.84, "duration": 6.72}, {"text": "change is not a prospective debate. It", "start": 483.68, "duration": 5.76}, {"text": "is a daily reality that strikes at the", "start": 486.56, "duration": 6.8}, {"text": "very foundations of our society. Rising", "start": 489.44, "duration": 6.879}, {"text": "seas strengthen our infrastructure, our", "start": 493.36, "duration": 5.279}, {"text": "coastal livelihoods, and our very", "start": 496.319, "duration": 4.0}, {"text": "territory.", "start": 498.639, "duration": 4.481}, {"text": "The science is undisputed.", "start": 500.319, "duration": 5.841}, {"text": "The targets are clear. What remains", "start": 503.12, "duration": 7.519}, {"text": "missing is political will and execution.", "start": 506.16, "duration": 7.359}, {"text": "Major emitters must display greater", "start": 510.639, "duration": 6.161}, {"text": "ambition while all nations act according", "start": 513.519, "duration": 5.281}, {"text": "to their responsibilities", "start": 516.8, "duration": 4.08}, {"text": "and capabilities.", "start": 518.8, "duration": 4.56}, {"text": "Economic growth that bankrupts the", "start": 520.88, "duration": 5.28}, {"text": "planet planet for future gener for", "start": 523.36, "duration": 6.32}, {"text": "future generations is not progress.", "start": 526.16, "duration": 6.96}, {"text": "Seashells therefore welcomes that the", "start": 529.68, "duration": 6.56}, {"text": "advisor advisory opinion of the", "start": 533.12, "duration": 5.6}, {"text": "international court of justice on", "start": 536.24, "duration": 5.84}, {"text": "climate change reinforcing that climate", "start": 538.72, "duration": 7.2}, {"text": "action is rooted in international law", "start": 542.08, "duration": 8.319}, {"text": "equity and intergenerational crisis.", "start": 545.92, "duration": 6.0}, {"text": "Mitigation,", "start": 550.399, "duration": 3.12}, {"text": "adaptation,", "start": 551.92, "duration": 4.56}, {"text": "technology transfer, and lost and damage", "start": 553.519, "duration": 6.32}, {"text": "funding are not acts of charity. They", "start": 556.48, "duration": 5.68}, {"text": "are legal obligations.", "start": 559.839, "duration": 5.68}, {"text": "Our survival is inextricably linked to", "start": 562.16, "duration": 7.2}, {"text": "the health of the ocean. Protecting our", "start": 565.519, "duration": 6.641}, {"text": "marine environment is an economic", "start": 569.36, "duration": 4.4}, {"text": "necessity.", "start": 572.16, "duration": 5.44}, {"text": "As an early ratifying a state of the of", "start": 573.76, "duration": 7.199}, {"text": "the BBNG agreement, Sichells looks", "start": 577.6, "duration": 6.08}, {"text": "forward to its first conference of the", "start": 580.959, "duration": 6.32}, {"text": "parties and urges all member states to", "start": 583.68, "duration": 7.44}, {"text": "finalize the ratifications swiftly.", "start": 587.279, "duration": 7.281}, {"text": "Yet our ambitions are hampered by", "start": 591.12, "duration": 6.8}, {"text": "structural economic barriers. Frameworks", "start": 594.56, "duration": 6.56}, {"text": "like the Antigua and Barbuda agenda for", "start": 597.92, "duration": 6.72}, {"text": "seeds and the Servila commitment must be", "start": 601.12, "duration": 6.96}, {"text": "backed by real capital for small island", "start": 604.64, "duration": 7.36}, {"text": "states. That sustainability is a matter", "start": 608.08, "duration": 6.16}, {"text": "of national survival.", "start": 612.0, "duration": 5.92}, {"text": "We would require affordable, accessible,", "start": 614.24, "duration": 6.719}, {"text": "long-term financing, meaningful death", "start": 617.92, "duration": 6.8}, {"text": "relief, and a full implementation of the", "start": 620.959, "duration": 5.601}, {"text": "multi-dimensional", "start": 624.72, "duration": 4.48}, {"text": "vulnerability index.", "start": 626.56, "duration": 5.6}, {"text": "Measuring a nation's development solely", "start": 629.2, "duration": 6.639}, {"text": "by GDP per capita ignores extreme", "start": 632.16, "duration": 6.64}, {"text": "exposure to climate shocks and", "start": 635.839, "duration": 5.921}, {"text": "geographic isolation.", "start": 638.8, "duration": 5.52}, {"text": "If international finance is to serve", "start": 641.76, "duration": 6.48}, {"text": "reality, it must first measure reality", "start": 644.32, "duration": 5.519}, {"text": "correctly.", "start": 648.24, "duration": 4.4}, {"text": "Looking ahead, we must also address the", "start": 649.839, "duration": 6.321}, {"text": "rapid rise of artificial intelligence", "start": 652.64, "duration": 6.4}, {"text": "and emerging technologies.", "start": 656.16, "duration": 5.76}, {"text": "Whilst these these tools offer immense", "start": 659.04, "duration": 5.919}, {"text": "opportunities for development and ocean", "start": 661.92, "duration": 6.479}, {"text": "management, they also risk widening the", "start": 664.959, "duration": 6.801}, {"text": "global divide and enabling new forms of", "start": 668.399, "duration": 7.201}, {"text": "warfare and cyber crime. We must ensure", "start": 671.76, "duration": 7.68}, {"text": "technology serves human dignity. We call", "start": 675.6, "duration": 6.88}, {"text": "for global digital governance anchored", "start": 679.44, "duration": 6.48}, {"text": "in human rights, ethical standards and", "start": 682.48, "duration": 5.919}, {"text": "international law with the United", "start": 685.92, "duration": 5.68}, {"text": "Nations playing a central role in", "start": 688.399, "duration": 6.161}, {"text": "steering this transformation.", "start": 691.6, "duration": 6.479}, {"text": "Mr. President, excellencies,", "start": 694.56, "duration": 6.56}, {"text": "across every crisis we face, one", "start": 698.079, "duration": 6.481}, {"text": "fundamental truth endures. Our ultimate", "start": 701.12, "duration": 7.2}, {"text": "duty is to the people who represent our", "start": 704.56, "duration": 7.04}, {"text": "families, our youth, our coastal", "start": 708.32, "duration": 6.8}, {"text": "communities and future generations.", "start": 711.6, "duration": 6.799}, {"text": "Our nations represent a rich tapestry of", "start": 715.12, "duration": 6.24}, {"text": "cultures, languages and political", "start": 718.399, "duration": 6.401}, {"text": "systems. But diversity need not breed", "start": 721.36, "duration": 6.719}, {"text": "division. Guided by our policy of friend", "start": 724.8, "duration": 6.479}, {"text": "to all and enmity to none, seals", "start": 728.079, "duration": 5.921}, {"text": "believes that our differences can be the", "start": 731.279, "duration": 6.24}, {"text": "dynamic foundation for stronger global", "start": 734.0, "duration": 5.04}, {"text": "cooperation.", "start": 737.519, "duration": 4.401}, {"text": "Let us restore trust through deliberate", "start": 739.04, "duration": 5.599}, {"text": "action by upholding the rule of", "start": 741.92, "duration": 5.84}, {"text": "international law unconditionally", "start": 744.639, "duration": 5.76}, {"text": "by reforming our global governance", "start": 747.76, "duration": 6.16}, {"text": "institutions to reflect today's world.", "start": 750.399, "duration": 5.921}, {"text": "By delivering delivering equitable", "start": 753.92, "duration": 5.919}, {"text": "climate and development finance and by", "start": 756.32, "duration": 7.68}, {"text": "protecting our shared oceans and climate", "start": 759.839, "duration": 7.601}, {"text": "sector this general assembly with deep", "start": 764.0, "duration": 6.88}, {"text": "humility, clear conviction and an", "start": 767.44, "duration": 6.079}, {"text": "unshakable belief in the multilateral", "start": 770.88, "duration": 6.48}, {"text": "system. We may be a small nation but our", "start": 773.519, "duration": 6.641}, {"text": "voice, our sovereignty and our", "start": 777.36, "duration": 6.24}, {"text": "aspirations will never be measured by", "start": 780.16, "duration": 8.799}, {"text": "our size on a map. Let this 81st session", "start": 783.6, "duration": 8.16}, {"text": "be remembered not for the divisions who", "start": 788.959, "duration": 5.68}, {"text": "inherit it but for the courage,", "start": 791.76, "duration": 5.68}, {"text": "solidarity and resolve with which you", "start": 794.639, "duration": 7.2}, {"text": "overcame them. Let us restore trust. Let", "start": 797.44, "duration": 8.0}, {"text": "us manage transformation and together", "start": 801.839, "duration": 6.481}, {"text": "let us build a United Nations that truly", "start": 805.44, "duration": 6.56}, {"text": "delivers for every nation and every", "start": 808.32, "duration": 6.24}, {"text": "human being. I thank you ladies and", "start": 812.0, "duration": 5.56}, {"text": "gentlemen.", "start": 814.56, "duration": 3.0}, {"text": "On behalf of the assembly, I wish to", "start": 821.6, "duration": 4.56}, {"text": "thank the president of the Republic of", "start": 823.36, "duration": 5.8}, {"text": "Seyos.", "start": 826.16, "duration": 3.0}]